3415
02:56:39,250 --> 02:56:39,630
Ah!

3416
02:56:42,850 --> 02:56:43,610
Pain.

3417
02:56:44,190 --> 02:56:44,990
Pure pain.

3418
02:56:45,650 --> 02:56:46,290
Suffering.

3419
02:56:48,690 --> 02:56:50,530
We don't need to fill the steel right now.

3420
02:56:55,870 --> 02:56:56,450
Yeah.

3421
02:56:58,250 --> 02:56:58,890
Are we good?

3422
02:57:00,790 --> 02:57:01,590
I think we're good.

3423
02:57:01,930 --> 02:57:02,310
Ascension.

3424
02:57:03,950 --> 02:57:05,410
Oh, we need this thing in here, of course.

3425
02:57:06,310 --> 02:57:07,150
Gotta bring this with us.

3426
02:57:11,700 --> 02:57:12,760
I am so ready.

3427
02:57:14,300 --> 02:57:15,780
I love capturing things.

3428
02:57:16,700 --> 02:57:17,800
Adding it to my collection.

3429
02:57:19,840 --> 02:57:21,020
We're going back into the nether.

3430
02:57:25,310 --> 02:57:27,030
And we're also gonna get some magma cream.

3431
02:57:29,210 --> 02:57:30,170
This is the current mission.

3432
02:57:39,660 --> 02:57:41,400
There's gonna be a skeleton in here?

3433
02:57:41,920 --> 02:57:42,280
Yep!

3434
02:57:48,220 --> 02:57:49,640
I saw that coming a mile away.

3435
02:57:52,400 --> 02:57:54,220
Let's not run, because we don't have a lot of food.

3436
02:57:54,400 --> 02:57:54,920
Let's go chill.

3437
02:58:02,020 --> 02:58:04,500
The problem is, getting back here is gonna be a little annoying now.

3438
02:58:11,450 --> 02:58:12,670
I need a faster way up.

3439
02:58:22,720 --> 02:58:23,420
You know what?

3440
02:58:23,600 --> 02:58:24,560
I am going to...

3441
02:58:33,620 --> 02:58:34,020
No.

3442
02:58:34,560 --> 02:58:35,180
No, no, no.

3443
02:58:35,320 --> 02:58:35,620
It's fine.

3444
02:58:37,460 --> 02:58:38,260
Let's go get one.

3445
02:58:42,160 --> 02:58:43,360
I'm not gonna waste my arrows.

3446
02:58:44,580 --> 02:58:45,080
Here we...

3447
02:58:45,080 --> 02:58:46,000
Oh, there's a lot over there.

3448
02:58:47,260 --> 02:58:48,060
Maybe too many.

3449
02:58:50,520 --> 02:58:51,600
I need them to shoot at me.

3450
02:58:53,160 --> 02:58:53,780
Come on.

3451
02:58:57,460 --> 02:58:58,400
Dodge that one.

3452
02:59:00,120 --> 02:59:00,520
Yike!

3453
02:59:00,900 --> 02:59:01,240
Haha!

3454
02:59:01,700 --> 02:59:02,160
Hee hee hee!

3455
02:59:02,300 --> 02:59:02,620
See ya!

3456
02:59:04,320 --> 02:59:06,040
Yup, yup, yup, yup, yup, yup!

3457
02:59:06,120 --> 02:59:06,520
Bye-bye!

3458
02:59:09,990 --> 02:59:10,530
Actually, hold on.

3459
02:59:10,590 --> 02:59:11,150
I'm not leaving yet.

3460
02:59:11,390 --> 02:59:11,890
I am leaving.

3461
02:59:13,230 --> 02:59:13,550
No!

3462
02:59:13,710 --> 02:59:14,550
I wanna kill these guys.

3463
02:59:14,930 --> 02:59:15,790
I need Magma Cream.

3464
02:59:15,990 --> 02:59:16,130
Oh!

3465
02:59:16,890 --> 02:59:17,410
Fuck you.

3466
02:59:17,470 --> 02:59:18,250
I thought I was out of range.

3467
02:59:23,160 --> 02:59:23,560
Got him.

3468
02:59:25,800 --> 02:59:26,900
They're still shooting at me!

3469
02:59:27,520 --> 02:59:29,120
Imagine if they pushed me off the edge here.

3470
02:59:35,180 --> 02:59:36,920
Okay, so they have almost despawned now.

3471
02:59:38,220 --> 02:59:38,960
We're going back.

3472
02:59:41,700 --> 02:59:42,020
We're...

3473
02:59:42,020 --> 02:59:42,880
Yeah, we're going back.

3474
02:59:43,740 --> 02:59:45,120
I saw a dude over there on the left.

3475
02:59:49,390 --> 02:59:49,870
It's okay.

3476
02:59:50,090 --> 02:59:50,450
That's okay.

3477
02:59:52,110 --> 02:59:53,330
You can try and shoot me if you want.

3478
03:00:03,420 --> 03:00:03,840
Oh god.

3479
03:00:08,880 --> 03:00:09,400
There we go!

3480
03:00:09,480 --> 03:00:09,880
We got something!

3481
03:00:16,900 --> 03:00:17,260
Yeah!

3482
03:00:17,980 --> 03:00:18,260
Oh!

3483
03:00:24,290 --> 03:00:25,110
I guess we leave.

3484
03:00:25,650 --> 03:00:26,730
I got what I came for.

3485
03:00:31,550 --> 03:00:32,070
See ya!

3486
03:00:35,250 --> 03:00:36,090
Wanna try and shoot me?

3487
03:00:38,030 --> 03:00:38,830
Nice try, brother.

3488
03:00:40,350 --> 03:00:40,950
Not today.

3489
03:00:44,120 --> 03:00:44,940
Nobody's gonna hit me.

3490
03:00:45,080 --> 03:00:45,260
Good.

3491
03:00:45,400 --> 03:00:45,640
Let's go!

3492
03:00:46,720 --> 03:00:49,060
This was such a successful little expedition.

3493
03:00:50,800 --> 03:00:51,500
Race is sharp.

3494
03:00:57,080 --> 03:00:58,320
I saw a guy up here, too.

3495
03:00:58,520 --> 03:00:58,740
Somewhere.

3496
03:00:59,580 --> 03:01:00,440
That I want to kill.

3497
03:01:11,390 --> 03:01:13,770
Would love to get a little more magma cream while I'm here.

3498
03:01:14,370 --> 03:01:15,670
Perhaps we got some...

3499
03:01:15,670 --> 03:01:16,990
magma boys somewhere.

3500
03:01:21,640 --> 03:01:23,780
They're usually over here, in this sort of biome, right?

3501
03:01:25,700 --> 03:01:27,880
They like to hang out near these lava places.

3502
03:01:32,400 --> 03:01:33,380
Oh yeah, this is...

3503
03:01:33,380 --> 03:01:33,460
No.

3504
03:01:34,500 --> 03:01:35,360
Hostile terrain.

3505
03:01:37,760 --> 03:01:38,560
No bueno.

3506
03:01:41,750 --> 03:01:42,310
Ah!

3507
03:01:42,470 --> 03:01:42,870
We got one.

3508
03:01:58,460 --> 03:01:59,640
Making a tiny path.

3509
03:02:19,970 --> 03:02:20,450
Hoy!

3510
03:02:21,550 --> 03:02:22,110
Wow.

3511
03:02:28,420 --> 03:02:29,280
I think I didn't panic.

3512
03:02:32,200 --> 03:02:33,060
He's right here.

3513
03:02:35,200 --> 03:02:35,760
Ah!

3514
03:02:36,720 --> 03:02:37,820
He was right there.

3515
03:02:40,840 --> 03:02:41,720
Don't fall down.

3516
03:02:44,840 --> 03:02:45,900
Gonna hit you at an angle.

3517
03:02:46,060 --> 03:02:47,140
Great, great, great.

3518
03:02:47,140 --> 03:02:48,280
Yeah, come in.

3519
03:02:48,440 --> 03:02:49,180
Come to me.

3520
03:02:49,560 --> 03:02:50,180
Come in here.

3521
03:02:51,760 --> 03:02:52,780
I know you want to get...

3522
03:02:52,780 --> 03:02:55,020
I don't want to kill you there, because you're going to fall down.

3523
03:02:55,180 --> 03:02:56,100
And it's not good for me.

3524
03:02:58,340 --> 03:02:59,440
Let me make some room for you.

3525
03:03:01,240 --> 03:03:01,560
There.

3526
03:03:02,040 --> 03:03:02,620
There we go.

3527
03:03:02,820 --> 03:03:03,200
Come, come here.

3528
03:03:03,280 --> 03:03:03,420
Come here.

3529
03:03:04,980 --> 03:03:06,160
Come at me, bro.

3530
03:03:06,460 --> 03:03:06,980
This way.

3531
03:03:07,460 --> 03:03:08,520
I welcome thee.

3532
03:03:13,090 --> 03:03:14,410
Oh shit, sorry.

3533
03:03:14,910 --> 03:03:15,650
Oh no.

3534
03:03:21,540 --> 03:03:22,240
Got him.

3535
03:03:37,470 --> 03:03:37,770
Hmm.

3536
03:03:38,110 --> 03:03:39,130
Do I even want to go here?

3537
03:03:39,970 --> 03:03:41,070
That's the question.

3538
03:03:42,070 --> 03:03:42,610
Methinks?

3539
03:03:42,730 --> 03:03:43,050
Maybe not.

3540
03:03:43,910 --> 03:03:44,470
No.

3541
03:03:55,130 --> 03:03:55,670
Go back.

3542
03:03:59,950 --> 03:04:00,690
What's this?

3543
03:04:02,570 --> 03:04:03,130
Scorchion.

3544
03:04:03,290 --> 03:04:03,390
Okay.

3545
03:04:05,890 --> 03:04:07,570
There are some weird blocks here.

3546
03:04:07,950 --> 03:04:08,510
Like...

3547
03:04:08,510 --> 03:04:10,570
Berydium and some other stuff.

3548
03:04:11,070 --> 03:04:12,610
Not really sure what to do with that.

3549
03:04:14,170 --> 03:04:15,450
Oh, we got another one.

3550
03:04:15,590 --> 03:04:16,090
Nice.

3551
03:04:19,430 --> 03:04:21,390
That's definitely like one magma cream.

3552
03:04:30,940 --> 03:04:32,140
I'm so good at that.

3553
03:04:35,150 --> 03:04:35,630
Oi.

3554
03:04:36,030 --> 03:04:36,090
Oi.

3555
03:04:39,320 --> 03:04:40,380
He's trying to crit me.

3556
03:04:47,650 --> 03:04:48,450
What's up, little guys?

3557
03:04:56,940 --> 03:04:57,720
Oh, come on.

3558
03:04:57,800 --> 03:04:58,880
Not a single one?

3559
03:05:00,000 --> 03:05:00,480
Man.

3560
03:05:01,800 --> 03:05:02,600
Never lucky.

3561
03:05:04,820 --> 03:05:05,780
Another one there now.

3562
03:05:12,370 --> 03:05:13,310
Oh, there's two of them.

3563
03:05:14,710 --> 03:05:15,770
Luck smiles upon me.

3564
03:05:21,670 --> 03:05:22,370
There we go.

3565
03:05:22,450 --> 03:05:22,770
We got one.

3566
03:05:37,900 --> 03:05:38,820
What are you doing up there?

3567
03:05:44,990 --> 03:05:45,430
Ow.

3568
03:05:47,990 --> 03:05:49,870
Dude, I really need some diamond armor here.

3569
03:05:50,570 --> 03:05:51,410
Or even better.

3570
03:05:51,810 --> 03:05:52,550
Netherite armor.

3571
03:05:56,640 --> 03:05:57,760
I hear ghosts everywhere.

3572
03:06:00,020 --> 03:06:00,600
Another one?

3573
03:06:06,480 --> 03:06:06,920
Okay.

3574
03:06:07,260 --> 03:06:07,860
Hey, you.

3575
03:06:14,570 --> 03:06:15,010
Okay.

3576
03:06:15,190 --> 03:06:16,130
I don't feel like leaving yet.

3577
03:06:19,070 --> 03:06:20,750
I actually kind of want to level up a little bit.

3578
03:06:32,590 --> 03:06:33,330
Level 20?

3579
03:06:51,990 --> 03:06:52,990
Am I seeing something?

3580
03:06:56,630 --> 03:06:57,910
I want to find a bastion.

3581
03:07:00,110 --> 03:07:01,190
I just want to locate it.

3582
03:07:01,290 --> 03:07:02,290
I'm not going to invade it yet.

3583
03:07:03,630 --> 03:07:05,550
Obviously, that's a bad idea with my current armor.

3584
03:07:16,090 --> 03:07:19,750
I gotta say, though, I love this part of the nether here.

3585
03:07:21,070 --> 03:07:22,910
It's just a very promising area, you know?

3586
03:07:24,530 --> 03:07:25,150
It's good.

3587
03:07:33,160 --> 03:07:37,740
Dude, I keep forgetting how good the Minecraft music is in the nether.

3588
03:07:41,520 --> 03:07:43,420
Every time I hear it, I'm like, oh yeah, right.

3589
03:07:44,060 --> 03:07:45,120
This thing slaps.

3590
03:08:00,420 --> 03:08:00,820
Thanks.

3591
03:08:04,520 --> 03:08:05,760
Dude, where is this ghost?

3592
03:08:05,800 --> 03:08:06,480
I hear it.

3593
03:08:07,100 --> 03:08:07,920
Is it right below me?

3594
03:08:09,800 --> 03:08:10,840
It's down there somewhere.

3595
03:08:12,200 --> 03:08:13,040
Or above me.

3596
03:08:13,200 --> 03:08:13,640
Could also be.

3597
03:08:29,940 --> 03:08:30,940
Okay, I think we're done now.

3598
03:08:31,940 --> 03:08:32,700
I'm happy.

3599
03:08:36,060 --> 03:08:37,360
Fantastic little excursion.

3600
03:08:42,100 --> 03:08:43,560
No, my music.

3601
03:08:45,360 --> 03:08:46,240
So sad.

3602
03:08:47,180 --> 03:08:48,960
They should let that track finish, you know?

3603
03:08:49,040 --> 03:08:49,920
Even if you go back here.

3604
03:08:50,400 --> 03:08:51,560
It's almost a crime.

3605
03:08:53,640 --> 03:08:54,960
So just stop it like that.

3606
03:09:03,730 --> 03:09:04,130
Okay.

3607
03:09:04,930 --> 03:09:07,230
So now that we have magma cream, we can actually make some potions.

3608
03:09:10,110 --> 03:09:11,030
First, we need water.

3609
03:09:19,030 --> 03:09:19,770
Take a couple.

3610
03:09:25,460 --> 03:09:26,080
Three of them.

3611
03:09:27,400 --> 03:09:28,900
Three magma cream is fantastic.

3612
03:09:30,660 --> 03:09:31,600
We needed this.

3613
03:09:32,180 --> 03:09:33,100
Let's see if I remember this.

3614
03:09:33,240 --> 03:09:34,120
So, one, two, three.

3615
03:09:35,100 --> 03:09:36,000
Magma cream first.

3616
03:09:36,140 --> 03:09:37,000
It's gonna make it awkward.

3617
03:09:37,800 --> 03:09:40,040
And then after that, we put in magma cream.

3618
03:09:41,260 --> 03:09:45,640
And then after that, we put redstone dust to extend the duration.

3619
03:09:46,900 --> 03:09:48,600
I should have a clipboard here with the...

3620
03:09:48,600 --> 03:09:50,100
Oh, that's actually so much better.

3621
03:09:51,040 --> 03:09:53,220
Clipboard with the ingredients, you know, for these things.

3622
03:09:53,300 --> 03:09:53,920
So I never forget.

3623
03:09:54,020 --> 03:09:54,760
And it's right next to it.

3624
03:09:54,800 --> 03:09:55,780
I don't have to carry a book around.

3625
03:09:57,180 --> 03:09:57,540
Genius.

3626
03:10:01,960 --> 03:10:02,500
Wait, what?

3627
03:10:06,160 --> 03:10:08,320
Hey, guys, I can make a clipboard when I have a clipboard.

3628
03:10:09,140 --> 03:10:09,860
That's crazy.

3629
03:10:12,040 --> 03:10:12,480
Huh?

3630
03:10:14,740 --> 03:10:15,720
Doesn't even make sense.

3631
03:10:18,060 --> 03:10:19,460
I mean, it kind of does.

3632
03:10:19,640 --> 03:10:20,520
It's like, hey, you have a clipboard?

3633
03:10:20,740 --> 03:10:21,920
That means you have a clipboard.

3634
03:10:23,160 --> 03:10:23,980
You're not wrong.

3635
03:10:26,860 --> 03:10:28,180
So that needed what exactly?

3636
03:10:28,400 --> 03:10:29,940
Paper and some other things?

3637
03:10:31,820 --> 03:10:32,700
Oak and...

3638
03:10:32,700 --> 03:10:33,500
And alloy.

3639
03:10:33,720 --> 03:10:33,800
Okay.

3640
03:10:35,680 --> 03:10:36,120
Paper.

3641
03:10:43,840 --> 03:10:44,680
What did I miss?

3642
03:10:45,640 --> 03:10:45,800
What?

3643
03:10:47,380 --> 03:10:47,520
What?

3644
03:10:47,520 --> 03:10:47,900
This.

3645
03:10:50,840 --> 03:10:51,440
Nice.

3646
03:10:56,280 --> 03:10:57,120
Right there.

3647
03:10:58,620 --> 03:10:59,480
Magma cream.

3648
03:11:01,000 --> 03:11:02,500
Makes fire protection.

3649
03:11:04,280 --> 03:11:05,460
That's actually so cool.

3650
03:11:07,660 --> 03:11:08,540
So awkward.

3651
03:11:08,840 --> 03:11:09,140
Great.

3652
03:11:09,400 --> 03:11:10,160
Now we put this in.

3653
03:11:13,300 --> 03:11:15,220
And after that, it's nether wart.

3654
03:11:15,560 --> 03:11:15,700
No.

3655
03:11:16,040 --> 03:11:16,640
Redstone dust.

3656
03:11:17,200 --> 03:11:18,340
Which means I gotta bring some.

3657
03:11:26,570 --> 03:11:27,050
Oh, wait.

3658
03:11:27,110 --> 03:11:27,830
I didn't put it on the wall.

3659
03:11:28,590 --> 03:11:29,230
There we go.

3660
03:11:29,830 --> 03:11:30,410
Now it's on the wall.

3661
03:11:31,910 --> 03:11:32,710
Fire resistance!

3662
03:11:33,270 --> 03:11:33,670
Yeah!

3663
03:11:37,200 --> 03:11:39,980
I'm trying to see if I remember the invisibility potion now.

3664
03:11:41,200 --> 03:11:48,220
I'm pretty sure it's weakness potion, and then you have to put something in the weakness potion.

3665
03:11:48,380 --> 03:11:51,380
So you have to make the potion first, and then use that as the base for the next one.

3666
03:11:52,920 --> 03:11:53,740
Something like that.

3667
03:11:56,460 --> 03:11:57,580
There we go, baby!

3668
03:11:58,100 --> 03:11:59,180
Local brewery!

3669
03:12:01,020 --> 03:12:02,420
Is that a Minecraft thingy?

3670
03:12:04,500 --> 03:12:05,380
Local brewery?

3671
03:12:07,780 --> 03:12:08,680
Oh, yeah, it is.

3672
03:12:16,140 --> 03:12:16,540
Yeah.

3673
03:12:17,040 --> 03:12:17,780
Okay, so what else?

3674
03:12:18,000 --> 03:12:18,460
Let me see here.

3675
03:12:20,740 --> 03:12:21,820
A strong breeze!

3676
03:12:22,980 --> 03:12:24,440
I could try and fix that now.

3677
03:12:24,700 --> 03:12:26,140
I kind of want to do the achievements, you know?

3678
03:12:29,040 --> 03:12:30,300
Should be pretty easy to do.

3679
03:12:30,860 --> 03:12:33,280
I guess I just need to add more sails to it.

3680
03:12:36,140 --> 03:12:36,540
Here.

3681
03:12:36,800 --> 03:12:37,400
Make babies.

3682
03:12:41,420 --> 03:12:42,140
There you go.

3683
03:12:44,740 --> 03:12:45,140
Sorry.

3684
03:12:46,260 --> 03:12:47,660
You have bread.

3685
03:12:48,740 --> 03:12:51,800
So now it's time for me to turn you into dead.

3686
03:13:01,820 --> 03:13:03,940
Oh, I need a gate, actually.

3687
03:13:15,890 --> 03:13:17,070
Hey, you mind going away?

3688
03:13:24,460 --> 03:13:24,900
Wonderful!

3689
03:13:26,900 --> 03:13:27,640
Much better.

3690
03:13:31,300 --> 03:13:32,080
Potions are done.

3691
03:13:32,760 --> 03:13:34,080
Let's leave them in this box.

3692
03:13:34,860 --> 03:13:35,840
Just for now, at least.

3693
03:13:40,260 --> 03:13:41,640
Gas tear is also an ingredient.

3694
03:13:43,260 --> 03:13:45,500
Oh, uh, blaze burner.

3695
03:13:47,420 --> 03:13:48,340
