5377
04:33:15,810 --> 04:33:16,310
Man.

5378
04:33:23,610 --> 04:33:26,770
I've never been a fan of cancer, sorry, but that was just kind of funny.

5379
04:33:32,190 --> 04:33:32,970
I mean, yeah.

5380
04:33:36,630 --> 04:33:39,470
Honestly, the only time cancer is good is when you're playing...

5381
04:33:40,610 --> 04:33:41,650
The Binding of Isaac.

5382
04:33:41,790 --> 04:33:42,650
That is the only time.

5383
04:33:44,930 --> 04:33:45,970
Then I welcome it.

5384
04:34:02,950 --> 04:34:04,690
Jackie's trying to jump up on me.

5385
04:34:05,530 --> 04:34:08,350
She knows it's about the end of the stream, so she's getting ready to play.

5386
04:34:09,410 --> 04:34:13,090
It's always so annoying, actually, because right when the stream ends, it's usually when I want to eat.

